sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as Caller, with its deadline
    participant Client as Fixed client code
    participant Retry as Retry middleware
    participant API as Other service's API

    Caller->>+Client: call of a listed operation
    Client->>+Retry: the call, with its mark
    alt the operation is not marked retryable
        Retry->>+API: one attempt
        API-->>-Retry: any outcome
    else the operation is marked retryable
        loop up to {API}_RETRY_ATTEMPTS, each within {API}_TIMEOUT
            Retry->>+API: attempt
            API-->>-Retry: answer, a status, or nothing
            Note over Retry: unavailable: WARN, wait backoff doubled, plus or minus 50 percent, unless the caller's deadline ends first
            Note over Retry: any other outcome: leave the loop
        end
    end
    Retry-->>-Client: the outcome of the last attempt
    Client-->>-Caller: the answer, or the outcome
